<title>INDIA: India's Digital 6-mth 96/97 net up.</title>
<headline>India's Digital 6-mth 96/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 28,</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    93.8  vs     67.9</p>
<p>    Net sales	  1,241.4  vs  1,024.2</p>
<p>    Other income	   3.3  vs	9.1</p>
<p>    Expenditure	1,073.3  vs    921.6</p>
<p>    Interest costs	 6.1  vs     10.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   19.6 vs     15.7</p>
<p>    Tax			51.8 vs     18.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Digital Equipment (India) Limited is 51 percent owned by Digital Equipment Corp.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that December 1995 figures of other income included profits from transfer of leasehold improvements and this is was a net loss on sale of fixed assets as of June 1996.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
